// A private sky as its own Worker.
//
// The same static site, built with the book's slice baked in
// (VITE_SKY_SLICE=book), deployed under a separate name so it never
// touches the production `website` Worker or its custom domain. The
// slice is cut on the author's machine and is not in the repository;
// this deployment is where a private sky lives, gated by Cloudflare
// Access at the hostname. CATHEDRALS.md §"Held" — the workspace's
// visibility: code public, private slices deployed privately.
//
//   pnpm deploy:book
{
  "$schema": "node_modules/wrangler/config-schema.json",
  "name": "book-sky",
  "compatibility_date": "2026-04-25",
  "assets": {
    "directory": "./dist/client",
    "not_found_handling": "404-page"
  }
}
